@page "/"

<PageTitle>CanDoItAll Code Analytics</PageTitle>

<div class="page-shell">
    <header class="hero">
        <span class="eyebrow">Standalone analysis workspace</span>
        <h1>CanDoItAll Code Analytics</h1>
        <p>
            Roslyn-first solution loading, deterministic architecture snapshots, lightweight SSR reporting,
            and a deliberately thin future seam for <code>CanDoItAll.Mcp.CodeAnalytics</code>.
        </p>
    </header>

    <section class="status-grid" aria-label="Bootstrap goals">
        <article class="status-card">
            <h2>Engine-first</h2>
            <p>The reusable libraries stay transport-agnostic so the future MCP driver only adds host wiring.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="status-card">
            <h2>Deterministic outputs</h2>
            <p>Snapshot storage, Markdown summaries, and Mermaid exports are planned around stable ordering.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="status-card">
            <h2>SSR-first UI</h2>
            <p>The first web surface is intentionally small, server-rendered, and focused on inspection rather than UI chrome.</p>
        </article>
    </section>
</div>
